    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Major features in Image Gallery Custom Post Type include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Automatically show the image gallery listing on to the front end.</li>\n<li>Support the custom post types.</li>\n<li>Shortcode use anywhere </li>\n<li>Fully free plugin </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Usage on editor:</p>\n<pre><code>  [show_gallery_img]\n</code></pre>\n<p>Use this shortcode for page template:</p>\n<pre><code>  &lt;?php echo do_shortcode(\"[show_gallery_img]\"); ?&gt;\n</code></pre>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Upload the Image Gallery Custom Post Type plugin to your blog:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the Image Gallery Custom Post Type plugin  to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date &#8211; 01 June 2019</em><br />\n* This is the current and latest version.</p>\n"
    },
